&lt;h2 id="void-protocol"&gt;VOID PROTOCOL
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;First-person wave shooter. You&amp;rsquo;re a reclamation process dropped into a block being freed — nothing inside it was ever finished, which is why every texture, sound, model and animation is generated in code at runtime. Not a single asset file.&lt;/p&gt;
